    {
      "id": "claim_8bac12b0195746e0a6356e240e1a0073",
      "statement": "The frontend's typed API client under frontend/src/api/ is code-generated from the backend's OpenAPI spec using openapi-generator-cli with the typescript-fetch generator, driven by the generate:openapi script in frontend/package.json which fetches http://localhost:8000/openapi.json; route operation_id values become generated client method names and route tags determine which generated *Api.ts class an endpoint belongs to.",
